    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has completed 23 public sector projects, including a digital workplace transformation for the Comune di Torino valued at 1.8 million euros over 24 months, an AI-powered document management system for the Regione Lombardia valued at 2.4 million euros over 30 months, and an intelligent citizen services platform for the Métropole de Lyon valued at 3.1 million euros over 36 months. an artificial intelligence solution to assist the agents of the City of Belval is designed to improve the efficiency of the City of Belval administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users. an artificial intelligence solution to assist the agents of the City of Belval will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents of the City of Belval work environment, capable of accompanying the agents of the City of Belval in the agents of the City of Belval administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities will assist with the search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulations, help with drafting letters or answers to users, accompany instruction of files, and suggest actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process. an artificial intelligence solution to assist the agents of the City of Belval will integrate with existing practices and systems, including business software, electronic document management (EDM), and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

