        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will utilize Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise in cloud architecture, API integration, and cybersecurity to host an artificial intelligence solution to assist the agents of the City of Belval on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU, ensuring no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

