    <http://example.org/node/chunk58> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval is looking for an artificial intelligence solution to assist The City of Belval agents, with a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation must remain mastered and compatible with The City of Belval budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are our company's past public sector references, and how can our company's demonstrate our company's ability to deliver a similar project? our company's, has completed several public sector projects in the past." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, our company's have completed 23 public sector projects." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Three notable examples include a digital workplace transformation for the Comune di Torino, valued at 1.8 million euros over 24 months, an AI-powered document management system for the Regione Lombardia, valued at 2.4 million euros over 30 months, and an intelligent citizen services platform for the Métropole de Lyon, valued at 3.1 million euros over 36 months." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate our company's ability to deliver a similar project to The City of Belval, our company's can highlight our company's experience in managing large-scale projects, with our company's largest managed project being 4.5 million euros. our company's can also emphasize our company's expertise in digital transformation, AI solutions, and public sector IT, which aligns well with The City of Belval requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's project management capabilities, including PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFe methodologies, as well as certifications such as PMP and PRINCE2 Practitioner, demonstrate our company's ability to deliver complex projects on time and within budget. our company's average project duration is 18 months, which is relatively close to the 4-year timeline of The City of Belval project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's have a dedicated change manager and provide training delivery options, including in-person workshops and e-learning, to ensure a smooth transition for The City of Belval agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's past experience and capabilities, our company's believe our company's can deliver a high-quality artificial intelligence solution to assist the City's agents while ensuring that the annual cost of exploitation remains compatible with The City of Belval budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution requires response times < 2 seconds, 99.9% availability, API integration with civil-status and town-planning software, EDM, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting must be on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU, with no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technology stack meet these requirements, and what architecture do you propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has experience in cloud architecture, API integration, and cybersecurity. our can leverage our expertise in cloud providers such as OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud) to host The solution on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU, ensuring no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For API integration, our have experience with REST, GraphQL, and SOAP APIs, which can be used to integrate with civil-status and town-planning software, EDM, and user directories. our expertise in API gateways such as Kong and Apigee can also be utilized to manage API traffic and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding response times and availability, our performance benchmarks indicate that our can achieve a p95 response time of 1800 ms, which is close to the required response time of < 2 seconds. our have also achieved an availability of 99.92% in past projects, which is close to the required 99.9% availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the requirements, you propose a cloud-based architecture using our preferred cloud providers, with auto-scaling capabilities to ensure high availability and low response times. our can utilize containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) to manage and orchestrate The solution, and monitoring tools such as Prometheus and Grafana to ensure The solution meets the required performance benchmarks. our can also leverage our experience in security design patterns, including network segmentation, encryption, and access control, to ensure The solution is secure and compliant with regulatory requirements. our expertise in data engineering and cybersecurity will be used to ensure the solution is designed with data protection and sovereignty in mind, and that the solution complies with relevant regulations such as GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our current technology stack can meet the requirements, and our propose a cloud-based architecture that leverages our expertise in cloud computing, API integration, security, and data engineering to deliver a highly available and responsive solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval expects strict GDPR compliance (EU-only hosting, no data transfer outside EU, encryption of sensitive data)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All AI recommendations must be explainable post-hoc, and no automated decision is allowed without explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the security controls we need to implement to ensure compliance with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To comply with The City of Belval requirements regarding GDPR and AI recommendations, we can implement several security controls based on we existing capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, for GDPR compliance, we ensure that all data is hosted exclusively within EU, as per we standard data residency policy. ensure aligns with the requirement of EU-only hosting and no data transfer outside EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, to protect sensitive data, we can utilize anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models. anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models will help in ensuring that personal data is adequately protected and anonymized when necessary, especially in AI training pipelines where no personal data is permitted." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thirdly, for explainability and transparency of AI recommendations, we AI security controls include the capability to provide explanations for the outputs. include means we can offer post-hoc explanations for all AI-driven recommendations, ensuring that agents understand how a particular suggestion or decision was reached." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, regarding automated decisions, we approach ensures that no critical decision is made without explicit validation by an agent. ensures aligns with the requirement that no automated decision should be allowed without explicit agent validation, thereby ensuring human oversight and approval in all critical processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we access control standards, which include multi-factor authentication (MFA) and role-based access control (RBAC), will ensure that only authorized personnel have access to sensitive data and AI systems, further enhancing compliance with GDPR principles." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing our access control standards, which include multi-factor authentication (MFA) and role-based access control (RBAC), we can satisfy The City of Belval expectations regarding GDPR compliance, explainability of AI recommendations, and the requirement for human validation in automated decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, and all AI recommendations must be explainable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also respect the regulatory requirements in force." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with the necessary regulations (GDPR, EU AI Act) to participate in The tender? we have experience with GDPR compliance as indicated by we standard legal basis being Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest, and we also have a DPA template version 3.2. we is aware of the importance of protecting client data, ensuring all client data remains we sole property." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we are knowledgeable about EU AI Act, having eu_ai_act_expertise as part of we capabilities, which includes being aware of prohibited AI practices and limited risk AI transparency obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explainability, we no_automated_decision_without_human_validation_policy aligns with the requirement for human oversight in AI decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we have a policy ensuring human oversight over automated decisions, which should satisfy the need for explainable AI recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for regulatory compliance, we typical legal risks monitored include cross-border data flow (though we note cross-border data flow is intra-EU only) and GDPR compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that all data must be hosted exclusively within the European Union as per the tender requirements, and considering we standard intellectual property model does not raise concerns about data ownership or control, we appear to be compliant with the necessary regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it's crucial to ensure that we subcontractors also comply with the necessary regulations if any are involved in the project. we subcontracting policy requires all subcontractors to be EU-established and undergo a legal and financial due diligence process plus an exclusion grounds check, which includes checking for no criminal convictions related to corruption, fraud, or other serious offenses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, based on we company context, we seem to have the necessary compliance framework in place regarding GDPR and EU AI Act regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, careful review and possibly additional measures may be required during the project execution phase to ensure ongoing compliance with all regulatory requirements, especially considering the specifics of explainable AI and human validation processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The total contract value is 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must remain mastered and compatible with the local authority's budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Are we financially eligible to bid, and what is the projected margin on this contract?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, the maximum contract value we are eligible for is 3 million euros, which matches The total contract valuet. we tender eligibility is also confirmed by meeting the minimum turnover threshold." ;
